      "updated": 1771314029194,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "command\ncreate a message\nsend a message\n\nEvents\nmessageCreated -> Event handeller\nFind all the user_id from the chat table for this post\nand send message to all the actore(user_id) and they\nsend back message to their WS connection.\nMessageSent->\nStore the ACK from clinet.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "command\ncreate a message\nsend a message\n\nEvents\nmessageCreated -> Event handeller\nFind all the user_id from the chat table for this post\nand send message to all the actore(user_id) and they\nsend back message to their WS connection.\nMessageSent->\nStore the ACK from clinet.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
